\fs14\
\b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns an NSFileHandle for writing to the pipe using NSFileHandle\'27s \b writeData:\b0 . When you are finished writing data to this object, send it \b closeFile\b0  to delete the descriptor, which causes the reading process to receive an end-of-data signal (an empty NSData). This object is automatically deallocated when the NSPipe is deallocated.\
